          "snippet": {
            "line": 192,
            "text": "theorem left_bound_to_weight {c a b d y C : ℝ} (hC : 0 ≤ C)\n    (hd : 0 < b-a-d) (hy : y ∈ Ioo a b) (hyl : y ≤ a+d)\n    {n N : ℕ} (hn : n ≤ N) :\n    C * FlatCutoff.edge c (y-a) / (y-a)^n ≤\n      (C / FlatCutoff.edge 4 (b-a-d)) * weight c a b y / edgeDistance a b y ^ N"
          }
